umugi is the bassist of rēve parfait."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsumugi quickly resorts to fighting and has a sharp tongue, but he has a straightforward personality and says what he thinks. Initially belonging to a different band, Reon invited and recruited Tsumugi after having been charmed by the latter's skill as a bassist. With Tsumugi joining, rēve parfait was formed. His deceased elder brother Momose Hiroto inspired Tsumugi to start playing the bass guitar."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of official website character profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47618"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/475475f7aac567558e10ed15a8dfcd6bb989d02db0afafe4bf4a9989477c5880.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/923192d47a2c6633b62f52f386c7fcbc571b235f6c232aac583579e58c4d0e12.webp","width":172,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 良平","creatorId":"vndb:s382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s382","name":"木村 良平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71206","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47622","characterName":"月野原 久遠","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47622"},"originalCharacterName":"月野原 久遠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"708"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kuon is the lead guitarist of rēve parfait."},{"spoiler":false